t_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1321814005":{"text":"그저... 당신의 아버지께서 살아있는 시체에게 습격을 당한 게 단순한 사고가 아닌 것 같아 조사를 하려는 거예요.","source_cn":"我只是觉得……你父亲可能并不是被活死人袭击而亡的，我想去调查一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F44D13B3153EE1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321814006:2":{"text":"음, 깊은 상처가 아니었는데도 지혈이 안 됐죠... 확실히 이상해요.","source_cn":"唔，明明不深但很难止血……确实有点蹊跷呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80CA1AFF587EA12D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321814008:1":{"text":"아까 그 장소로 돌아가서 제대로 수색해봐야 할 것 같습니다. 분명히 단서를 찾을 수 있을 겁니다.","source_cn":"我们有必要回刚才的地方好好进行一番搜索，一定能找到有用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C2B613E3B7F8A3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321814009:1":{"text":"그럼, 팔라모르... 돌아올 거죠?","source_cn":"那……法拉莫尔……你，你会回来的吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE0A14141620A6AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321814010:1":{"text":"그럼요. 믿어주세요, 알겠죠?","source_cn":"一定会的。相信我，好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA32A37BE8A599B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"